post-it: Icons don't open
cause: Screenshot set as wallpaper
symptoms:
	Icons don't open
checks:
	Desktop icons open
		shows: the icons are only part of the wallpaper, a picture of the desktop
	Wallpaper is not a picture of the desktop
		shows: Display Properties lists the wallpaper as "prank"
	Icons are on the desktop
		shows: a New Folder, mostly off the screen in the bottom right corner, holds them
software steps:
	Open the folder hidden in the corner
	Drag every icon in it onto the desktop
	Change the wallpaper in Display Properties
